1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 22=

2
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,120
Things have come to this.

3
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:31,280
There is no turning back for me.

4
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:49,960
One day,

5
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,000
when my soul returns,

6
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:58,240
we will be a family reunited again.

7
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,320
The traitor Songpiao

8
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:18,160
rebelled using the name of Lu Cen,

9
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:20,560
(Arrest Warrant)
murdered loyal ministers,

10
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,840
and plotted to form
a faction to usurp the throne.

11
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,800
This is treacherous

12
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,520
(Arrest Warrant)
and heinous.

13
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,500
(Arrest Traitor Songpiao)

14
00:02:27,570 --> 00:02:29,020
- Xiaobai.
- Ordered for nationwide arrest.

15
00:02:29,330 --> 00:02:30,580
- Xiaobai!
- Anyone who captures him

16
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:31,800
or provides clues...

17
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,280
Xiaobai.

18
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:32,960
What are you doing?

19
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,120
They will be rewarded.

20
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,840
Where is Xiaobai?

21
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,000
Miss Xiaobai isn't here.

22
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,950
Anyone who dares to hide or harbor him

23
00:02:37,180 --> 00:02:38,230
will share the same crime,

24
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:40,400
- Where is she?
- with their head being hung at Wumen.

25
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,640
Miss Xiaobai left the legal house

26
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,120
and said she wouldn't come back.

27
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,000
Did she say where she was going?

28
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,560
She went to the pier.

29
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:32,720
What are you doing?

30
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,440
Are you still not clear about it?

31
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,320
Only by killing you

32
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,400
can I succeed to the throne.

33
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,040
Then let me tell you,

34
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,840
I have severed ties with Mother.

35
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:51,960
I demoted myself to a commoner

36
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,040
and am no longer a prince.

37
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,720
I have had no interest
in the throne since I was young.

38
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,320
Now,

39
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:59,640
I only want to find
Jiang Xiaobai as soon as possible

40
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:01,600
and fly away with her.

41
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,400
Get out of the way!

42
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,960
They are all Jingshu's people.

43
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,320
We are nothing more than

44
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,880
pawns of Jingshu.

45
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,440
We have fallen into a trap.

46
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,040
Be careful!

47
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,400
Go.

48
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,280
I only now know

49
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,080
it was my mother

50
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,560
who killed your mother.

51
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:56,240
I know apologizing now

52
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,440
cannot make up for anything.

53
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:03,880
I am not begging for
your forgiveness for her either.

54
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,080
No.

55
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,360
But I

56
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:14,000
must say...

57
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,560
Songpiao,

58
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,680
I'm sorry.

59
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,160
No,

60
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:25,400
these things
have nothing to do with you.

61
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,280
I was wrong.

62
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,960
I misunderstood you.

63
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,960
Go.

64
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,960
I must take you away.

65
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,360
Take this.

66
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,360
Find...

67
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,560
Find Jiang Xiaobai for me.

68
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:05,040
Tell her

69
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,280
to live well.

70
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:15,560
No.

71
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:16,680
If you want to go,

72
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:19,000
go by yourself.

73
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:20,360
Let's go.

74
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,760
I will take you to find her.

75
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,720
Go!

76
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,160
If you don't leave now,

77
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:32,360
we will die here.

78
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,360
Sizhou.

79
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,600
Sizhou!

80
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:01,480
Sizhou!

81
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,480
Sizhou!

82
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,960
Your Highness,

83
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,800
the men sent out just now reported

84
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,560
that they have brought back

85
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:38,360
the First Prince's body.

86
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,880
It didn't attract anyone's attention.

87
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,000
But

88
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,600
the Second Prince escaped.

89
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:49,160
Tidy up Zhou's remains carefully.

90
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:53,360
I don't want to see any stains on him.

91
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:55,080
Yes, Your Highness.

92
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:06,400
(Jingshu,)

93
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,960
(if I look back,)

94
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,880
(all of this)

95
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,200
(will be over.)

96
00:09:21,710 --> 00:09:24,310
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

97
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:27,670
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

98
00:09:28,310 --> 00:09:30,070
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

99
00:09:30,070 --> 00:09:32,990
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

100
00:09:35,430 --> 00:09:37,870
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

101
00:09:38,230 --> 00:09:41,550
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

102
00:09:42,150 --> 00:09:43,710
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

103
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:47,190
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

104
00:09:49,950 --> 00:09:52,830
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

105
00:09:53,350 --> 00:09:56,430
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

106
00:09:56,870 --> 00:09:59,470
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

107
00:09:59,470 --> 00:10:03,510
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

108
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:06,790
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

109
00:10:07,190 --> 00:10:09,870
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

110
00:10:09,870 --> 00:10:12,590
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

111
00:10:12,870 --> 00:10:15,830
♪I'll only say that once♪

112
00:10:16,310 --> 00:10:18,070
♪I called your name♪

113
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:24,910
♪The silent stars hang low♪

114
00:10:26,310 --> 00:10:28,510
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

115
00:10:29,750 --> 00:10:31,670
♪I linger in the old tower♪

116
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:35,430
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

117
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:39,190
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

118
00:10:40,070 --> 00:10:42,870
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

119
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:45,870
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

120
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:52,110
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

121
00:10:52,390 --> 00:10:55,270
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

122
00:10:55,870 --> 00:10:59,350
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

123
00:10:59,350 --> 00:11:01,990
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

124
00:11:01,990 --> 00:11:06,270
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

125
00:11:06,270 --> 00:11:09,190
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

126
00:11:09,630 --> 00:11:12,350
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

127
00:11:12,350 --> 00:11:15,030
♪If we meet again in another life♪

128
00:11:15,350 --> 00:11:18,070
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

129
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:21,030
♪Was when we first met?♪

130
00:11:22,310 --> 00:11:24,710
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

131
00:11:25,830 --> 00:11:27,590
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
